<title>POLAND: STOMIL-SANOK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL-SANOK FEB NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.09 vs   0.84</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.73 vs   0.84</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.45 vs   0.85</p>
<p> Sales		   12.85 vs  10.84</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.35 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.00 vs   1.05</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.40 vs   1.08</p>
<p> Sales		   24.47 vs  20.40</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Sanok SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
